Search your local Booki bookmarks from Alfred.

Usage:
  bk &lt;query&gt;     fuzzy-search bookmarks
  ↵              open in default browser
  ⌘ + ↵          copy URL to clipboard

Configuration (Workflow Environment Variables):
  booki_host    default http://127.0.0.1:8765
  booki_kinds   comma-separated kind filter — empty = all
                e.g. "bookmark", "bookmark,video"

